{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>העד העד.</b> A term of warning — an unequivocal warning, where one warns him in the presence of witnesses; and so ״וְהָעִדֹתִי בָכֶם\" (Jeremiah 11); ״רֵד הָעֵד בָּעָם\" (Exodus 19)." "<b>לא תראו פני בלתי אחיכם אתכם.</b> You shall not see me without your brother with you; and Onkelos translated: אֶלָּהֵן כַּד אֲחוּכוֹן עִמְּכוֹן — the matter rests on its face, and he did not press to translate according to the language of Scripture."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:18.687697220Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}